  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM ES NFI Herat Earthquake Response October 2023- 4th Reserve Allocation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Since the first earthquake incident earlier in October 2023, up to 49,000 families were affected by earthquake in Afghanistan. All of these families are in need of emergency winterization, shelter, and rental assistance. IOM proposes Cash-based intervention (CBI); cash-for-winterization and cash-for-rent in Herat province. The support provides a temporary shelter solution during the winter period until affected families are able to repair their damaged houses after the winter period.</narrative>
  </description>
